{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】有議員引述政府稱，早前完成試用期未能「轉正」的約200位郵政署員工，日後投考公務員職位時可獲優先取錄。這是否郵政轉型與員工轉業可行方法？</p><p>周三的《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：郵政轉型與員工轉業</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.187737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:05:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:31.847359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:31.847359+00:00","content_hash":"4784b7f5b0c61d362fd1dd38aacd36190d315ee19296d66be7854669f084cb57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}